              "text": "توجیه کردن (towjih kardan) — \"to justify\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "او نمیتواند رفتارش را توجیه کند. u nemitavânad raftârash râ towjih konad. He cannot justify his behaviour."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Towjih \"justification; explanation\" + kardan. It also means to brief someone on a task."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "توجیه was borrowed from Arabic tawjīh (EtymDB), a verbal noun usually explained as turning something to face the right way; kardan \"to do\" is inherited Persian."
            }
          ]
        },
